---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import ProjectCard from "@/components/ProjectCard.astro";
import { projects } from "@/data/projects";
import { site } from "@/data/site";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import duckyPortrait from "@/assets/about/ducky-portrait.png";
---

<Layout title="Home">
  <section aria-labelledby="hero-heading" class="px-6 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <p
        class="mb-5 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-pyroduck-lime"
      >
        Create. Solve. Keep learning.
      </p>

      <h1
        id="hero-heading"
        class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-brand-text sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
      >
        Practical websites.
        <span class="block text-pyroduck-plasma"> Creative solutions. </span>
      </h1>

      <p
        class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-muted sm:text-xl"
      >
        I’m Brent, also known as Ducky. I’m building my experience in web
        development through real projects that help people and organizations
        connect with their communities.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 sm:justify-start">
        <a
          href="#work"
          class="rounded-lg bg-pyroduck-plasma px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-pyroduck-void transition-colors hover:bg-pyroduck-lime focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-pyroduck-lime"
        >
          Explore My Work
        </a>

        <a
          href="#contact"
          class="rounded-lg border border-pyroduck-plasma px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-brand-text transition-colors hover:bg-pyroduck-plasma/15 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-pyroduck-lime"
        >
          Work With Me
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="work"
    aria-labelledby="work-heading"
    class="scroll-mt-32 px-6 py-16 sm:py-24"
  >
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <p
        class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-pyroduck-lime"
      >
        My portfolio
      </p>

      <h2
        id="work-heading"
        class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text sm:text-4xl"
      >
        Learning through real projects.
      </h2>

      <div class="project-grid mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        {projects.map((project) => <ProjectCard {...project} />)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="about"
    aria-labelledby="about-heading"
    class="scroll-mt-32 px-6 py-16 sm:py-24"
  >
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <p
        class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-pyroduck-lime"
      >
        About me
      </p>

      <h2
        id="about-heading"
        class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text sm:text-4xl"
      >
        A little about Ducky.
      </h2>

      <div
        class="mt-8 grid items-start gap-8 md:grid-cols-[260px_minmax(0,1fr)]"
      >
        <Image
          src={duckyPortrait}
          alt="Brent, also known as Ducky."
          width={520}
          format="webp"
          loading="lazy"
          class="mx-auto aspect-square w-full max-w-64 rounded-2xl border border-pyroduck-plasma/40 object-cover md:mx-0"
        />

        <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-muted">
          <p>
            I've always enjoyed technology and gadgets, but around 2023 I
            started exploring more of what goes into them. After building Hope
            House Hub and my first website in mid-2026, I found that I
            especially enjoy the creative side of frontend development—working
            with colors, layouts, and details until a page feels right.
          </p>

          <p>
            I like figuring things out, learning with help along the way, and
            building something other people might use or enjoy. Working on the
            Hope House Guthrie website encouraged me to finally turn my own
            little "under construction" page into something more that I could
            share.
          </p>

          <p>
            PyroDuck Tech is a place for me to grow, experiment, and try ideas
            while I pursue my degree in cybersecurity. My friend TJ is part of
            that journey, sharing ideas and building alongside me. I'm also open
            to website projects where we can put our skills to work together.
          </p>

          <p>
            Away from coding, I enjoy Magic: The Gathering—building decks,
            finding artwork I like, and gradually replacing my proxies with the
            cards I want to own. That interest inspired{" "}
            <a
              href="/mtg"
              class="rounded-sm font-semibold text-pyroduck-plasma transition-colors hover:text-pyroduck-lime focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-pyroduck-lime"
            >
              BinderLink
            </a>, a project I’m building where players can create chase lists,
            list cards for sale, and connect with other collectors.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="contact"
    aria-labelledby="contact-heading"
    class="scroll-mt-32 px-6 py-16 sm:py-24"
  >
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl border-t border-pyroduck-plasma/25 pt-12">
      <p
        class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-pyroduck-lime"
      >
        Work with me
      </p>

      <h2
        id="contact-heading"
        class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text sm:text-4xl"
      >
        Have a website in mind?
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-muted">
        I’m open to website projects and opportunities to keep growing as a
        developer. Have an idea? Let’s talk.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-start gap-5">
        <a
          href={site.projectInquiryUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-pyroduck-plasma px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-pyroduck-void transition-colors hover:bg-pyroduck-lime focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-pyroduck-lime"
        >
          Tell me about your project
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
        </a>

        <p class="text-brand-muted">
          Prefer email?{" "}
          <a
            href="mailto:ducky@pyroduck.tech"
            class="rounded-sm font-semibold text-pyroduck-plasma transition-colors hover:text-pyroduck-lime focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-pyroduck-lime"
          >
            ducky@pyroduck.tech
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .project-grid {
      position: relative;
      isolation: isolate;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
